  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This spatial dataset represents the locations of abandoned aggregate sites (pits and quarries) that have not been rehabilitated for various reasons, including:\n<ul>\n<li>the site predates legislation that requires rehabilitation</li>\n<li>the site was revoked, and no rehabilitation has been completed</li>\n</ul>\nInformation about active aggregate sites is available in related data classes and online using the interactive <a href='https://www.ontario.ca/page/find-pits-and-quarries' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Pits and Quarries</a> map.\n\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></div>\n<div>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Aggregate%20Site%20Unrehabilitated%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Aggregate Site Unrehabilitated - Data Description (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\t\t<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Aggregate%20Site%20Unrehabilitated%20-%20Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Aggregate Site Unrehabilitated - Documentation (Word)</a><br /></li>\n\t</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong></div>\n\n<div>On going: data is being continually updated</div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></div>\n\n<div>As needed: data is updated as deemed necessary</div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong></div>\n\n<div>Ryan Lenethen, Integration Branch, <a href='mailto:ryan.lenethen@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>ryan.lenethen@ontario.ca</a></div>"
